# Build output — never ship the host's bin/obj into the image (stale/other-arch).
**/bin/
**/obj/

# IDE / tooling
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/*.user

# Not needed to publish Govori.Api / Govori.Worker
tests/
init-solution.sh
**/*.md

# Docker artefacts (the builder reads the Dockerfile out-of-band)
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.gitignore
